---
title: "get_round_details GET /v1/integration/rounds/{id} (Legion Backend API)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: api_key = headers["x-api-key"]
    q_auth --> q_check_key: api_key valid
    q_check_key --> q_sign: identifier = round_id
    q_check_key --> q_reject: api_key invalid
    q_reject --> [*]: revert "unauthorized"
    q_sign --> q_compute_sig: signature = HMAC_SHA256(secret_key, round_id)
    q_compute_sig --> q_send: GET /v1/integration/rounds/{id} with X-Signature
    q_send --> q_parse: response = server_response
    q_parse --> q_found: response.status == 2xx
    q_parse --> q_not_found: response.status == 404
    q_parse --> q_error: response.status == other error
    q_found --> [*]: return round_details
    q_not_found --> [*]: revert "round not found"
    q_error --> [*]: revert "fetch round failed"

    note right of q_sign
        INV-001: round_id is used as the signing identifier for GET
        INV-002: round details include comprehensive info for the specific round
        INV-003: round_id in path must match the identifier used for signing
    end note
